    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a trap... like we're all just performing this huge, exhausting play for an audience that isn't even there. if there's no objective meaning, then why even bother with the struggle of it all? why keep pushing through the pain when the end result is just more emptiness?",
